                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is super interesting. I don't understand all the negativity here... its almost similar to the game Singularity but with a quicker and simpler  learning curve with various add-ons and extensions for units and buildings. The method of capturing structures and building units is really simple and fast paced as if everything is within your reach. Expanding your terrartory is also fast paced making it fun to play. I highly recommend giving it a try 10/10",
